      en: ["The monument was officially completed and inaugurated in 2009.", "The total height is 24 meters, including the 9-meter high pedestal.", "It is situated on a ridge approximately 110 meters above sea level.", "Constructed primarily from fiberglass with an internal steel framework.", "Ranked as one of the largest statues of Jesus Christ in Central America.", "The viewpoint offers views extending to the northern coast of Costa Rica."],
